| `tickCount`       | `number`                                          | `undefined`     | Max X ticks (first + last always kept)        |
| `formatValue`     | `(label: CategoryValue, index: number) => string` | `undefined`     | Custom X-axis label formatter                 |
| `xAxisLabel`      | `boolean`                                         | `false`         | Show label below tick marks                   |
| `xAxisLabelValue` | `string`                                          | `'xAxis label'` | Text for the X-axis label                     |

When `xAxisConfig` is provided, AreaGroup automatically applies dynamic left/right padding so the first and last tick labels don't clip.

#### HoverBadgeConfig

| Prop          | Type                                                                          | Default     | Description                                                                     |
| ------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `formatValue` | `(value: number, label?: string) => string`                                   | `undefined` | Custom formatter for the hover badge value                                      |
| `formatBadge` | `(value: number, label?: string, secondaryValue?: number) => DataBadgeConfig` | `undefined` | Structured formatter returning a multi-section badge config                     |
| `preset`      | `'chartKeys'`                                                                 | `undefined` | Preset configuration — `'chartKeys'` shows a per-series color-keyed breakdown   |

### DataDisplay Config (`dataDisplayConfig`)

`dataDisplayConfig` mirrors `DataDisplayProps` (Layer 2 + Layer 3) and adds chart-specific hover behaviour. When `mode="hover"`, the chart overwrites `mainLabelValue`, `dataHead.dataLeadValue`, and `badgeConfig.value` from the hovered series.

#### Chart-specific behaviour

| Prop                    | Type                                                   | Default    | Description                                                |
| ----------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ | ---------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |
| `mode`                  | `'static' \| 'hover'`                                  | `'static'` | `'hover'` updates lead value and badge on area hover       |
| `formatHoverLeadValue`  | `(seriesTotal: number, seriesName?: string) => string` | `undefined` | Formats `dataHead.dataLeadValue` in hover mode             |
| `formatHoverBadgeValue` | `(seriesTotal: number, seriesName?: string) => string` | `undefined` | Formats `badgeConfig.value` in hover mode                  |

#### DataDisplay Layer 2 props (mirrored)

| Prop                       | Type                          | Default  | Description                                                |
| -------------------------- | ----------------------------- | -------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |
| `mainLabelValue`           | `string`                      | `''`     | Label text above the DataHead value                        |
| `alignment`                | `'Left' \| 'Center'`          | `'Left'` | Layout: `'Left'` horizontal, `'Center'` vertical stacked   |
| `rightBadgeWrapper` | `boolean`                     | `true`   | Show the right-column section                              |
| `badgeTop`                 | `boolean`                     | `false`  | Show badge in top slot                                     |
| `badgeBottom`              | `boolean`                     | `true`   | Show badge in bottom slot                                  |
| `showBadge`                | `boolean`                     | `true`   | Show or hide all badge instances                           |
| `supportingBadgeLabel`     | `boolean`                     | `true`   | Show supporting label next to the badge                    |
| `supportingBadgeLabelValue`     | `string`                      | `''`     | Supporting label text next to the badge                    |
| `size`                | `'XS' \| 'S' \| 'M' \| 'L' \| 'XL'` | `'L'`  | Typography size variant                             |

#### DataDisplay Layer 3 configs (forwarded)

| Prop         | Type             | Default | Description                                       |
| ------------ | ---------------- | ------- | ------------------------------------------------- |
| `dataHead`   | `DataHeadConfig` | `{}`    | Lead value, supporting data, and supporting label |
| `badgeConfig`| `BadgeConfig`    | `{}`    | Badge value, appearance, and autoDetect           |

### ChartFooter Config (`chartFooterConfig`)

