| ---------------------- | --------- | ----------- | ------------------------ |
| `annotationLeft`       | `boolean` | `false`     | Show left annotation     |
| `annotationLeftValue`  | `string`  | `undefined` | Source attribution text  |
| `annotationRight`      | `boolean` | `false`     | Show right annotation    |
