When the container is too narrow to fit all category labels, overflow items are grouped into an "Others" multi-bar. The "Others" bar aggregates per-series values from all overflow categories (e.g., if Series A has values 10, 20, 30 across three overflow categories, the "Others" bar shows Series A = 60).

