# VerticalStackedBarChart

## Overview

A complete vertical stacked bar chart component that composes `ChartHeader`, `ChartLegend`, `DataDisplay`, `VerticalStackedBarGroup`, and `ChartFooter` into a cohesive data visualization. All tokens (colours, typography, spacing, DataVis palette) come from the CSS `@layer brand` cascade — no `modes` prop, no runtime JS resolver.

**This component follows the Organized Props Pattern** — Layer 2 parent props (`data`, `width`, `chartHeader`, etc.) plus Layer 3 child configs (`chartHeaderConfig`, `chartLegendConfig`, `barGroupConfig`, `chartFooterConfig`, `dataDisplayConfig`) grouped by the child component they configure.

## Figma Reference

- **Node ID**: `133:2318`
- **Design File**: DataVis-Components
- **Figma URL**: https://www.figma.com/design/uA5ExvS0cNXbDEKzT9Rnrt/DataVis-Components?node-id=133-2318

## Architecture

```
VerticalStackedBarChart (flex container, vertical layout)
├── ChartHeader (conditional, when chartHeader=true)
│   ├── ChartTitle
│   └── ChartSubtitle
├── ChartLegend (conditional, when chartLegend=true)
│   └── ChartKey[] (6 items for categorical colors)
│       ├── Circle indicator (categorical color)
│       └── Label
├── DataDisplay (conditional, when dataDisplay=true)
│   ├── contentLeft
│   │   ├── mainLabel (inline typography + optional InfoIcon)
│   │   └── DataHead (DataLead + SupportingData + SupportingLabel)
│   └── contentRight (DataBadgeSemantic)
├── VerticalStackedBarGroup
│   ├── YAxis (optional, when yAxis=true)
│   │   └── ChartAxisTick (for each tick value)
│   ├── AvgLine (optional, when avgLine=true)
│   └── contentWrapper (flex, space-between)
│       └── VerticalStackedBar[] (D3-scaled heights)
│           ├── topOutsideLabel (optional total)
│           ├── stackedBars (pill radius container)
│           │   └── shapeRect[1-6] (colored segments)
│           └── categoryLabel
└── ChartFooter (conditional, when chartFooter=true)
    ├── source (inline typography tokens)
    └── notes (inline typography tokens)
```

## Canonical Default Render

> **This is what consumers should get when they request a `VerticalStackedBarChart` without supplying extra detail.** It is the spec: the `Default` story in `VerticalStackedBarChart.stories.tsx` matches this exactly, and any future change to the canonical baseline must update the story, this section, and the meta `docs.description` together.

### What's ON by default

| Part                            | Default                 | Why                                                                                                            |
| ------------------------------- | ----------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `ChartHeader`                   | **ON**                  | Title + subtitle anchor the chart so the reader knows what they're looking at                                  |
| `ChartLegend`                   | **ON**                  | Stacked-series charts always need the per-series colour key (segment identity isn't legible otherwise)         |
| `barGroupConfig.categoryLabels` | **ON**                  | The X-axis identifies each bar                                                                                 |
| `barGroupConfig.yAxis`          | **ON** (opt-in — prop defaults to `false`) | Quantitative reference for the bar totals; ticks share the bar group's D3 scale. The canonical baseline turns it on explicitly since most product charts want it |
| `barGroupConfig.hoverBadge`     | **ON**                  | Cursor-following `DataBadge` for per-segment value reveal — always paired with `hoverType: "individual"` below |
| `barGroupConfig.hoverType`      | **`"individual"`**      | Per-segment focus on hover so the hoverBadge surfaces the specific segment's value, not just the bar total     |
| `ChartFooter`                   | **ON**                  | Slot for source / footnote annotations                                                                         |
| `interactive`                   | **ON** (default `true`) | Bars / segments receive hover / click / focus handlers                                                         |
| `barGroupConfig.barWidth`       | **`"M"`**               | Default bar width                                                                                              |
| `barGroupConfig.barHeightMode`  | **`"relative"`**        | Real-magnitude stacking; switch to `"fullHeight"` only for 100% stacked / composition charts                   |
| `width`                         | **`520`**               | Chart width in pixels — comfortable Storybook frame width (the prop's own bare default is `328`); consumers should override to match their layout |

### What's OFF by default (opt-in only)

| Part                                                  | When to enable                                                                                                                                    |
| ----------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `dataDisplay`                                         | Only when the chart is paired with a primary KPI / summary surface that benefits from a static or hover-driven `DataDisplay` block above the bars |
| `barGroupConfig.topLabels`                            | Only when bar widths are wide enough (`barWidth: "L"` and above) and the total above each bar adds value                                          |
| `barGroupConfig.avgLine`                              | Comparison against the dataset mean bar-total or a fixed threshold                                                                                |
| `barGroupConfig.barHeightMode: "fullHeight"`          | 100% stacked / composition charts (market share, allocation, mix shift) where every bar should reach full height and segments are proportions     |
| Non-default `hoverType` (`"group"` / `"categorical"`) | Switch to `"group"` when the bar-as-unit is the right interaction target, or `"categorical"` (same series across bars) for series comparison      |
| `animated`                                            | Datasets that change at runtime (filters, scenario toggles)                                                                                       |
| `seriesOrder` / `valueFormat` / `dataSort`            | Domain-specific ordering / formatting / sorting needs                                                                                             |
| `categoryLabelConfig` overrides                       | Long category names that need word / line-clamp tuning                                                                                            |
| `accessibility.enabled`                               | Production charts (always opt in for shipped charts; off in this default for the rendered Storybook demo)                                         |

### Minimal canonical example

```tsx
<VerticalStackedBarChart
  data={canonicalData}
  width={520}
  chartHeader
  chartLegend
  chartFooter
  chartHeaderConfig={{
    chartTitleValue: "Quarterly revenue by product.",
    chartSubtitleValue: "Stacked segments show each product's contribution to total revenue.",
  }}
  barGroupConfig={{
    categoryLabels: true,
    yAxis: true,
    yAxisConfig: { tickCount: 6 },
    barWidth: "M",
    hoverBadge: true,
    hoverType: "individual",
  }}
  chartFooterConfig={{
    annotationLeftValue: "Source: Jio.",
    annotationRightValue: "FY 2024.",
  }}
/>
```

> **Authoring rule:** when a consumer (human or LLM) asks for "a VerticalStackedBarChart" without further detail, render the example above — _not_ the `Anatomy` story (everything turned on at once). Anatomy exists as a reference; the default is what ships in real product surfaces.

## Import

```tsx
import { VerticalStackedBarChart } from './charts/VerticalStackedBarChart';
```

## Data Formats

### StackedBarDataPoint (Legacy)

```tsx
interface StackedBarDataPoint {
  label: string; // Category label (e.g., "Jan")
  segments: StackedBarSegment[]; // Array of segments (max 6)
  totalLabel?: string; // Optional custom total label
}
```

### StackedBarSegment

```tsx
interface StackedBarSegment {
  value: number; // Segment value
  label?: string; // Segment label (for legend)
  color?: string; // Custom color override
}
```

## Props Interface (Organized Props Pattern)

```tsx
import { StackedBarDataPoint } from "../../groups/VerticalStackedBarGroup";
import { ChartLegendItem } from "../../groups/ChartLegend";
import { ValueFormatConfig } from "../../groups/VerticalStackedBarGroup";

/** Props for the ChartHeader child component */
type ChartHeaderConfig = Pick<
  ChartHeaderProps,
  "chartTitleValue" | "chartSubtitleValue" | "title" | "subtitle" | "titleId" | "subtitleId"
>;

/** Props for the ChartLegend child component */
interface ChartLegendConfig {
  items?: ChartLegendItem[];
  type?: "circle" | "dashed" | "line";
  dataHead?: boolean;
  dataHeadConfig?: {
    dataLeadValue?: number | string;
    dataSupportingValue?: number | string;
    supportingLabelValue?: string;
    supportingData?: boolean;
    supportingLabel?: boolean;
  };
  /** Updates legend item(s) DataHead lead value on hover. Requires `dataHead: true`.
   * "individual"/"categorical" hoverType updates only the hovered series; "group"
   * hoverType updates every series at once with that category's breakdown. */
  interactiveDataHead?: boolean;
  formatHoverSupportingLabel?: (category: CategoryValue, seriesIndex: number) => string;
  size?: "XS" | "S" | "M" | "L" | "XL";
  ariaLabel?: string;
  ariaLabelledBy?: string;
}

/** Props for Y-Axis configuration */
interface YAxisConfig {
  tickCount?: number;
  formatValue?: (value: number) => string;
  valueFormat?: ValueFormatConfig;
  yAxisLabel?: boolean;
  yAxisLabelValue?: string;
  axisTickSkipper?: boolean;
  skippedTicks?: number[];
}

/** Props for AvgLine configuration */
interface AvgLineConfig {
  formatValue?: (value: number) => string;
  type?: "avg" | "threshold";
  thresholdValue?: number;
}

/** Props for Hover Badge configuration */
interface HoverBadgeConfig {
  formatValue?: (value: number, label?: string) => string;
  formatBadge?: (value: number, label?: string, secondaryValue?: number) => DataBadgeConfig;
  preset?: HoverBadgePreset;
}

/** Props for the VerticalStackedBarGroup child component */
interface BarGroupConfig {
  topLabels?: boolean;
  categoryLabels?: boolean;
  yAxis?: boolean;
  avgLine?: boolean;
  yAxisConfig?: YAxisConfig;
  avgLineConfig?: AvgLineConfig;
  valueFormat?: ValueFormatConfig;
  barWidth?: string;
  barHeightMode?: BarHeightMode; // 'fullHeight' | 'relative' (default: 'relative')
  hoverType?: StackedBarHoverType;
  hoverBadge?: boolean;
  hoverBadgeConfig?: HoverBadgeConfig;
  categoryLabelConfig?: CategoryLabelConfig;
  dataSort?: DataSortOrder; // "asc" | "desc" | "unsorted" (default: "unsorted")
  /** Enable entry and data-change animations with motion tokens (default: false) */
  animated?: boolean;
  onBarHover?: (data: VerticalStackedBarHoverData) => void;
  onBarClick?: (data: VerticalStackedBarHoverData) => void;
  /** Back-compat alias for `highlightedBarIndices`. */
  hoveredBarIndex?: number | number[];
  /** Indices of bars rendered at full opacity; every other bar dims. */
  highlightedBarIndices?: number[];
}

/** Props for the ChartFooter child component */
type ChartFooterConfig = Pick<
  ChartFooterProps,
  "annotationLeft" | "annotationLeftValue" | "annotationRight" | "annotationRightValue"
>;

/**
 * Props for the DataDisplay child component.
 * Mirrors DataDisplayProps structure (Layer 2 + Layer 3), with additional
 * chart-specific props for hover behaviour.
 * When mode is "hover", mainLabelValue, dataHead.dataLeadValue, and
 * badgeConfig.value updates dynamically on hover.
 */
interface DataDisplayConfig {
  // --- Chart-specific behaviour ---
  /** Display mode: "static" uses provided values, "hover" updates dynamically on hover (default: "static") */
  mode?: "static" | "hover";
  /** Custom formatter for lead value in hover mode (receives segment value, category, segmentIndex) */
  formatHoverLeadValue?: (value: number, category?: CategoryValue, segmentIndex?: number) => string;
  /** Custom formatter for badge value in hover mode (receives segment value, category, segmentIndex) */
  formatHoverBadgeValue?: (
    value: number,
    category?: CategoryValue,
    segmentIndex?: number
  ) => string;

  // --- DataDisplay Layer 2 props ---
  /** The main label text above the data value */
  mainLabelValue?: string;
  /** Layout alignment: "Left" (horizontal) or "Center" (vertical stacked) (default: "Left") */
  alignment?: "Left" | "Center";
  /** Toggle visibility of the rightBadgeWrapper section (default: true) */
  rightBadgeWrapper?: boolean;
  /** Toggle visibility of the badgeTop slot (default: false) */
  badgeTop?: boolean;
  /** Toggle visibility of the badgeBottom slot (default: true) */
  badgeBottom?: boolean;
  /** Toggle visibility of the OneUI Badge in supporting slots (default: true) */
  showBadge?: boolean;
  /** Toggle visibility of the supporting label next to the badge (default: true) */
  supportingBadgeLabel?: boolean;
  /** The supporting label text next to the badge */
  supportingBadgeLabelValue?: string;
  /** Local size variant for typography scaling: "XS", "S", "M", "L", or "XL" (default: "L") */
  size?: "XS" | "S" | "M" | "L" | "XL";

  // --- DataDisplay Layer 3 configs ---
  /** Configuration for the DataHead child component */
  dataHead?: DataHeadConfig;
  /** Configuration for the Badge + SupportingLabel in supporting slots */
  badgeConfig?: BadgeConfig;
}

interface VerticalStackedBarChartProps {
  // Layer 2: Parent component props
  /**
   * Supports canonical format (ChartSeriesDataPoint[]) or legacy format (StackedBarDataPoint[])
   */
  data: ChartSeriesDataPoint[] | StackedBarDataPoint[];
  seriesOrder?: string[]; // Control segment stacking order for canonical format
  width?: number | string;
  height?: number | string;
  /** Stretch chart to fill parent container width. Default: false. */
  fullWidth?: boolean;
  chartHeader?: boolean;
  chartFooter?: boolean;
  chartLegend?: boolean;
  dataDisplay?: boolean; // Show DataDisplay component above bars
  interactive?: boolean;
  animated?: boolean;

  // Layer 3: Child component configurations
  chartHeaderConfig?: ChartHeaderConfig;
  chartLegendConfig?: ChartLegendConfig;
  dataDisplayConfig?: DataDisplayConfig; // Configuration for DataDisplay
  barGroupConfig?: BarGroupConfig;
  chartFooterConfig?: ChartFooterConfig;

  // Accessibility
  /** Accessibility configuration for screen readers */
  accessibility?: AccessibilityConfig;
}
```

## Props

### Parent Component Props (Layer 2)

| Prop          | Type                                              | Default | Description                                                                   |
| ------------- | ------------------------------------------------- | ------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `data`        | `ChartSeriesDataPoint[] \| StackedBarDataPoint[]` | `[]`    | Array of data points (canonical or legacy format)                             |
| `seriesOrder` | `string[]`                                        | -       | Control segment stacking order for canonical format                           |
| `width`       | `number \| string`                                | `328`   | Total width of the chart                                                      |
| `height`      | `number \| string`                                | `440`   | **Total height of the chart.** VerticalStackedBarGroup fills remaining space. |
| `chartHeader` | `boolean`                                         | `true`  | Show/hide the chart header                                                    |
| `chartFooter` | `boolean`                                         | `true`  | Show/hide the chart footer                                                    |
| `chartLegend` | `boolean`                                         | `true`  | Show/hide the chart legend                                                    |
| `dataDisplay` | `boolean`                                         | `false` | Show DataDisplay component above the bar group                                |
| `fullWidth`   | `boolean`                                         | `false` | Stretch chart to fill parent container width (overrides `width`)              |
| `interactive` | `boolean`                                         | `true`  | Enable hover/click interactivity on bars                                      |
| `animated`    | `boolean`                                         | `false` | Enable entry and data-change animations with motion tokens                    |

### ChartHeader Config (`chartHeaderConfig`)

| Prop                 | Type      | Default     | Description                                                |
| -------------------- | --------- | ----------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |
| `chartTitleValue`    | `string`  | `undefined` | Chart title text (ChartHeader shows placeholder text if unset) |
| `chartSubtitleValue` | `string`  | `undefined` | Chart subtitle text (ChartHeader shows placeholder text if unset) |
| `title`              | `boolean` | `true`      | Show/hide the title row                                     |
| `subtitle`           | `boolean` | `true`      | Show/hide the subtitle row                                  |
| `titleId`            | `string`  | `undefined` | Forwarded to the rendered title's `<p id>` — wire `aria-labelledby` to it |
| `subtitleId`         | `string`  | `undefined` | Forwarded to the rendered subtitle's `<p id>` — wire `aria-describedby` to it |

### ChartLegend Config (`chartLegendConfig`)

| Prop                         | Type                                                       | Default                       | Description                                                                                                                       |
| ---------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------ | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `items`                      | `ChartLegendItem[]`                                        | `undefined` (auto from series) | Manual legend items — overrides auto-generation from series names                                                                 |
| `type`                       | `"circle" \| "dashed" \| "line"`                           | `"circle"`                    | Indicator shape variant for auto-generated legend items                                                                           |
| `dataHead`                   | `boolean`                                                  | `false`                        | Show a static DataHead block (e.g. a running total) below each auto-generated legend item                                        |
| `dataHeadConfig`             | `{ dataLeadValue?, dataSupportingValue?, supportingLabelValue?, supportingData?, supportingLabel? }` | `undefined` | Static DataHead values applied to every auto-generated legend item                                                                |
| `interactiveDataHead`        | `boolean`                                                  | `false`                        | Updates legend item DataHead lead value(s) live on hover. Requires `dataHead: true`. With `barGroupConfig.hoverType: "individual"` or `"categorical"`, only the hovered series' legend item updates. With `hoverType: "group"`, every legend item updates together with that category's per-series breakdown |
| `formatHoverSupportingLabel` | `(category: CategoryValue, seriesIndex: number) => string` | `undefined`                    | Custom formatter for the supporting label text shown on hover                                                                     |
| `size`                       | `"XS" \| "S" \| "M" \| "L" \| "XL"`                        | `undefined`                    | Typography size variant — controls legend item scaling                                                                            |
| `ariaLabel`                  | `string`                                                   | `undefined`                    | Forwarded to ChartLegend's `aria-label`                                                                                            |
| `ariaLabelledBy`             | `string`                                                   | `undefined`                    | Forwarded to ChartLegend's `aria-labelledby`; takes precedence over `ariaLabel` when set                                          |

### BarGroup Config (`barGroupConfig`)

| Prop                    | Type                                       | Default      | Description                                                                                           |
| ----------------------- | ------------------------------------------ | ------------ | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `topLabels`             | `boolean`                                  | `false`      | Show value labels above bars                                                                          |
| `categoryLabels`        | `boolean`                                  | `true`       | Show category labels below bars                                                                       |
| `yAxis`                 | `boolean`                                  | `false`      | Show Y-axis with tick marks                                                                           |
| `avgLine`               | `boolean`                                  | `false`      | Show horizontal average line                                                                          |
