| `avgLineConfig`         | `AvgLineConfig`                            | `undefined`  | Average line configuration (see sub-table below)                                                      |
| `valueFormat`           | `ValueFormatConfig`                        | `undefined`  | Value format configuration                                                                            |
| `barWidth`              | `string`                                   | `"M"`        | T-shirt sizing: XS, S, M, L, XL, 2XL                                                                  |
| `barHeightMode`         | `"fullHeight" \| "relative"`               | `"relative"` | `"fullHeight"` stretches all bars to full height (100% stacked); `"relative"` shows cumulative values |
| `hoverType`             | `"group" \| "individual" \| "categorical"` | `"individual"` | Hover type: group, individual, or categorical                                                       |
| `hoverBadge`            | `boolean`                                  | `true`       | Show hover badge with value on bar hover                                                              |
| `hoverBadgeConfig`      | `HoverBadgeConfig`                         | `undefined`  | Hover badge configuration (see sub-table below)                                                       |
| `categoryLabelConfig`   | `CategoryLabelConfig`                      | `undefined`  | Category label truncation, overflow grouping, and layout. See sub-table below                         |
| `dataSort`              | `DataSortOrder`                            | `"unsorted"` | Sort bars by total segment value: `"asc"`, `"desc"`, or `"unsorted"`                                  |
| `animated`              | `boolean`                                  | `false`      | Enable entry and data-change animations (overridden by parent `animated` prop when set)               |
| `onBarHover`            | `function`                                 | `undefined`  | Callback fired when any bar hover state changes                                                       |
| `onBarClick`            | `function`                                 | `undefined`  | Callback fired when any bar is clicked                                                                |
| `highlightedBarIndices` | `number[]`                                 | `undefined`  | Indices of bars rendered at full opacity; every other bar dims (multi-bar highlight)                  |
| `hoveredBarIndex`       | `number \| number[]`                       | `undefined`  | Back-compat alias for `highlightedBarIndices`. Accepts single index or array                          |

#### `yAxisConfig`

| Prop              | Type                        | Default         | Description                                                                                           |
| ----------------- | --------------------------- | --------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `tickCount`       | `number`                    | `6`             | Target number of Y-axis ticks                                                                         |
| `formatValue`     | `(value: number) => string` | `undefined`     | Custom formatter for Y-axis labels                                                                    |
| `valueFormat`     | `ValueFormatConfig`         | `undefined`     | Value format configuration for Y-axis labels (overrides `formatValue` and parent-level `valueFormat`) |
| `yAxisLabel`      | `boolean`                   | `false`         | Show rotated label to the left of tick marks                                                          |
| `yAxisLabelValue` | `string`                    | `"yAxis label"` | Text content for the Y-axis label                                                                     |
| `axisTickSkipper` | `boolean`                   | `false`         | Show the axis break indicator (auto-enabled when `skippedTicks` is provided)                          |
| `skippedTicks`    | `number[]`                  | `undefined`     | Tick values to skip — the range [min, max] defines the break zone                                     |

#### `avgLineConfig`

| Prop          | Type                        | Default     | Description                        |
| ------------- | --------------------------- | ----------- | ---------------------------------- |
| `formatValue` | `(value: number) => string` | `undefined` | Custom formatter for average value |

#### `hoverBadgeConfig`

| Prop          | Type                                        | Default     | Description                                                                                                                                |
| ------------- | ------------------------------------------- | ----------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |
| `formatValue` | `(value: number, label?: string) => string` | `undefined` | Custom formatter for hover badge display                                                                                                   |
| `formatBadge` | `function`                                  | `undefined` | Structured formatter returning `DataBadgeConfig` for multi-section hover badges                                                            |
| `preset`      | `"chartKeys"`                               | `undefined` | Preset for automatic hover badge configuration. "chartKeys" shows per-series color-keyed breakdown. Custom `formatBadge` takes precedence. |

#### `categoryLabelConfig`

Controls truncation, multi-line wrapping, and overflow grouping of category labels. Uses shared utilities from `src/utils/categoryLabelUtils.ts`.

| Property                 | Type                                | Default       | Description                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
| ------------------------ | ----------------------------------- | ------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `maxWords`               | `number`                            | `3`           | Maximum words per label before truncation (appends "…")                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |
| `maxLines`               | `number`                            | `2`           | Maximum display lines per label (CSS `-webkit-line-clamp`)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
| `othersLabel`            | `string`                            | `"Others"`    | Label text for the overflow group                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
| `overflowType`           | `"grouped" \| "truncated" \| "all"` | `"truncated"` | `"truncated"` (default): bars that don't fit are removed from the right. `"grouped"`: overflow items aggregated into an "Others" stacked bar. `"all"`: every bar is rendered but in-between category labels are skipped to prevent overlap (hovering any bar — including those with hidden labels — reveals the full category name in the HoverBadge and the `onBarHover` callback) |
| `skippedLabels`          | `"auto" \| number`                  | `"auto"`      | Only used when `overflowType` is `"all"`. `"auto"` dynamically calculates which labels to show based on available width (first and last always included). A `number` sets an explicit skip interval (e.g., `1` = every other label, `2` = every 3rd)                                                                                                                                |
| `enableOverflowGrouping` | `boolean`                           | `false`       | **Deprecated** — use `overflowType` instead. `true` maps to `"grouped"`, `false` maps to `"truncated"`                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
| `labelWidth`             | `"fluid" \| number`                 | `"fluid"`     | `"fluid"`: labels expand to fill space with design-token gaps. `number`: fixed pixel width per label                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
| `othersPosition`         | `"sorted" \| "end"`                 | `"sorted"`    | `"sorted"`: positioned by accumulated value. `"end"`: pinned to far right                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
| `othersHeight`           | `"relative" \| "full" \| number`    | `"relative"`  | Height mode for the "Others" bar. For stacked bars, "Others" aggregates per-segment values from overflow bars                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |

