## Usage Examples

### Basic Usage (Organized Props)

```tsx
import { VerticalStackedBarChart } from './charts/VerticalStackedBarChart';

const data = [
  {
    label: "Jan",
    segments: [
      { value: 30, label: "Product A" },
      { value: 25, label: "Product B" },
      { value: 20, label: "Product C" },
    ],
  },
  {
    label: "Feb",
    segments: [
      { value: 35, label: "Product A" },
      { value: 30, label: "Product B" },
      { value: 15, label: "Product C" },
    ],
  },
];

<VerticalStackedBarChart data={data} />;
```

### Full Configuration

```tsx
<VerticalStackedBarChart
  data={data}
  width={400}
  height={300}
  chartHeader={true}
  chartFooter={true}
  chartLegend={true}
  chartHeaderConfig={{
    chartTitleValue: "Monthly Revenue by Product",
    chartSubtitleValue: "Q1 2024 Performance Overview",
  }}
  barGroupConfig={{
    topLabels: true,
    yAxis: true,
    barWidth: "M",
  }}
  chartFooterConfig={{
    annotationLeftValue: "Source: Finance Team",
    annotationRightValue: "*In thousands USD",
  }}
/>
```

### With DataDisplay (Static Mode)

```tsx
<VerticalStackedBarChart
  data={data}
  dataDisplay={true}
  chartHeaderConfig={{
    chartTitleValue: "Monthly Revenue",
    chartSubtitleValue: "Stacked by product category",
  }}
  dataDisplayConfig={{
    mode: "static",
    mainLabelValue: "Total revenue",
    dataHead: {
      dataLeadValue: "£2,390",
      dataSupportingValue: "/ 3,000",
      supportingLabel: true,
      supportingLabelValue: "Monthly target",
    },
    badgeConfig: {
      value: "+23.5%",
      autoDetect: true,
    },
  }}
/>
```

### With DataDisplay (Hover Mode)

DataDisplay updates dynamically when hovering over segments:

```tsx
<VerticalStackedBarChart
  data={data}
  dataDisplay={true}
  interactive={true}
  chartHeaderConfig={{
    chartTitleValue: "Monthly Revenue",
  }}
  dataDisplayConfig={{
    mode: "hover",
    mainLabelValue: "Hover a segment to see details",
    dataHead: {
      dataLeadValue: "-",
    },
    rightBadgeWrapper: false,
  }}
  barGroupConfig={{
    hoverType: "individual",
  }}
/>

```

### With DataDisplay (Hover Mode + Custom Formatters)

```tsx
<VerticalStackedBarChart
  data={data}
  dataDisplay={true}
  interactive={true}
  dataDisplayConfig={{
    mode: "hover",
    mainLabelValue: "Select a segment",
    formatHoverLeadValue: (value, category, segmentIndex) =>
      `Segment ${segmentIndex}: £${value.toLocaleString()}`,
    formatHoverBadgeValue: (value) => {
      const percent = ((value / totalRevenue) * 100).toFixed(1);
      return `${percent}%`;
    },
  }}
  barGroupConfig={{
    hoverType: "individual",
  }}
/>

```

### Without Header

```tsx
<VerticalStackedBarChart
  data={data}
  chartHeader={false}
  chartFooter={true}
  chartLegend={true}
/>

```

### Without Footer

